    "limitations": [
        "This corpus and its static checks are not evidence of an executed Copilot session.",
        "At least two complete rounds per actual surface/harness/platform/version/workspace target are required; 95% category accuracy is an improvement target, not a statistical guarantee.",
        "Unsupported, unclarified ambiguous, and denied-approval cases require zero collector execution.",
        "Actual approval and denial receipts must be captured by a human; never synthesize receipts.",
        "Approved catalog and exact help commands do not collect evidence; they are distinct from collection and never justify retries after denial."
